OL,3,GOrkney & Shetland
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FIt will be a dry day today with
OL,6,Fsome good spells of sunshine. Fresh
OL,7,Fnorthwesterly winds easing down this
OL,8,Fmorning and backing southwesterly this
OL,9,Fafternoon.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FThis evening will be dry with
OL,12,Fclear periods. Then the rest of the
OL,13,Fnight will be dry with clear periods,
OL,14,Fperhaps a light shower later on.
OL,15,
OL,16,CThursday:FAfter a dry morning
OL,17,Foutbreaks of rain will spread from the
OL,18,Fwest in the afternoon and early
OL,19,Fevening along with freshening
OL,20,Fsoutheasterly winds.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
