OL,3,GOrkney & Shetland
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FMainly
OL,6,Fdry on Friday with sunny spells and
OL,7,Fthe odd passing shower. Rain will
OL,8,Fspread east on Saturday, drier by
OL,9,Fevening. Dry and bright on Sunday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
